      "text": "[3:34PM] #PWD #TrafficUpdate \n\nThe stretch from Ile Zik through Ayayi Farm, Ikeja Along, and National en route Airport Turning is clear, while PWD, Shogunle, Ladipo, and Bolade Junction are also free for movement.\n\nThe return routes are equally clear, with no impediments or obstructions reported.\nOur officers are on ground effectively managing traffic situation.\n\n#FollowLASTMA",
